  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-10-02-blast-ethereum-layer-2-shutting-down-417583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Paradigm-backed Layer 2 Blast to wind down network as costs exceed revenue</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/03/openpayd-targets-year-end-nasdaq-listing-to-fund-u-s-expansion-and-acquisitions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Payments firm OpenPayd targets year-end Nasdaq listing to fund U.S. expansion and acquisitions</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOT1dnS0c5LWR0RDBHdDhGWEVMaDhTeWctLXpqS2Y0Z0tQM2t0a0xhTk5sejRGZWlWUktBeGNzbGNjOWtZRi1UckItVGNsdk1zM2NWaXMxRHlRcHZEbG85UWdid0hoTjhnNUhNckx6bDh5ZjF5WnZNVUxXd2VBT19xTGFMeVdLT1E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC completes its crypto agenda with custody rule | CoinDesk Videos</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko